---
layout: layouts/base
title: Accueil
description: "Nimara — Boulangerie & traiteur artisan à Genève. Pâtisseries, cuisine du monde et service traiteur sur mesure."
bodyClass: page-home
---

<!-- ══ HERO ══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="hero hero--full">
  <div class="hero-bg-mosaic" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mosaic-cell mosaic-cell--1" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585937421612-70a008356fbe?w=600')"></div>
    <div class="mosaic-cell mosaic-cell--2" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509365390695-33aee754301f?w=600')"></div>
    <div class="mosaic-cell mosaic-cell--3" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605090930601-14490a2afcdb?w=600')"></div>
    <div class="mosaic-cell mosaic-cell--4" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565557623262-b51c2513a641?w=600')"></div>
    <div class="mosaic-overlay"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--lavender-lt)">Boulangerie-Traiteur · Genève</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title display-serif">
        Il y a du goût.<br>Il y a <em>Nimara</em>.
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Pâtisseries artisanales, cuisine du monde et traiteur sur mesure —
        préparés chaque jour dans notre atelier genevois.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/carte/" class="btn btn-primary">Découvrir la carte</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text={{ site.whatsappMessage | urlencode }}"
           class="btn btn-light"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/>
          </svg>
          Commander sur WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>Découvrir</span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
      <path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ UNIVERS 1 — NOS DOUCEURS ═══════════════ -->
<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="universe-split">
      <div class="universe-text animate-fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow">Atelier sucré</span>
        <h2 class="display-serif">Nos Douceurs</h2>
        <p>
          De la pâte feuilletée au cheesecake spéculos, chaque création sort du four
          chaque matin. Banana Bread caramélisé, Brookie fondant, Cinnamon Roll glaçage
          vanille, Pecan Pie caramel… des douceurs qui racontent une passion.
        </p>
        <div class="universe-badges">
          <span class="ubadge">Fait maison</span>
          <span class="ubadge">Sans additifs</span>
          <span class="ubadge">Artisanal</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/carte/#sucre" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Voir nos douceurs</a>
      </div>
      <div class="universe-mosaic animate-fade-up" style="transition-delay:.12s">
        <div class="umosaic-grid">
          <div class="umosaic-img umosaic-img--tall" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605090930601-14490a2afcdb?w=600')"></div>
          <div class="umosaic-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606313564200-e75d5e30476c?w=600')"></div>
          <div class="umosaic-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509365390695-33aee754301f?w=600')"></div>
          <div class="umosaic-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524351199678-941a58a3df50?w=600')"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ UNIVERS 2 — SAVEURS DU MONDE ═══════════ -->
<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="universe-split universe-split--reverse">
      <div class="universe-mosaic animate-fade-up">
        <div class="umosaic-grid">
          <div class="umosaic-img umosaic-img--tall" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585937421612-70a008356fbe?w=600')"></div>
          <div class="umosaic-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565557623262-b51c2513a641?w=600')"></div>
          <div class="umosaic-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601050690597-df0568f70950?w=600')"></div>
          <div class="umosaic-img" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476224203421-9ac39bcb3327?w=600')"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="universe-text animate-fade-up" style="transition-delay:.12s">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--lavender)">Cuisine du monde</span>
        <h2 class="display-serif" style="color:white">Saveurs du Monde</h2>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)">
          Samosas légumes-menthe, pakoras épinards, naans beurre-ail,
          curry poulet masala, dal rouge, saag aloo… Une cuisine d'épices
          et de générosité, préparée avec des recettes authentiques et des
          ingrédients soigneusement sélectionnés.
        </p>
        <div class="universe-badges">
          <span class="ubadge ubadge--light">Halal</span>
          <span class="ubadge ubadge--light">Végétarien</span>
          <span class="ubadge ubadge--light">Épices maison</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/carte/#sale" class="btn btn-light" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Explorer les saveurs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ PRODUITS STRIP ═════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Nos incontournables</span>
      <h2>Ce qui fait revenir<br>nos clients chaque semaine</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="product-strip-scroll">
      {% set highlights = [
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605090930601-14490a2afcdb?w=400", name: "Banana Bread", tag: "Douceurs", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606313564200-e75d5e30476c?w=400", name: "Brownie", tag: "Douceurs", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524351199678-941a58a3df50?w=400", name: "Cheesecake Spéculos", tag: "Douceurs", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509365390695-33aee754301f?w=400", name: "Cinnamon Roll", tag: "Douceurs", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585937421612-70a008356fbe?w=400", name: "Curry Poulet Masala", tag: "Saveurs du Monde", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601050690597-df0568f70950?w=400", name: "Samosas", tag: "Saveurs du Monde", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565557623262-b51c2513a641?w=400", name: "Naans", tag: "Saveurs du Monde", price: "" },
        { img: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476224203421-9ac39bcb3327?w=400", name: "Assortiment", tag: "Traiteur", price: "" }
      ] %}
      {% for p in highlights %}
      <div class="product-strip-card">
        <div class="product-strip-img" style="background-image:url('{{ p.img }}')"></div>
        <div class="product-strip-body">
          <span class="product-strip-tag">{{ p.tag }}</span>
          <div class="product-strip-name">{{ p.name }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:2rem">
      <a href="/carte/" class="btn btn-outline">Voir toute la carte</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TRAITEUR B2B ════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section section--violet">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:center;gap:4rem">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--lavender-lt)">Partenaires B2B</span>
        <h2 style="color:white;margin-bottom:1rem">
          Nimara, partenaire de vos<br>événements d'entreprise
        </h2>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          Petit-déjeuner d'équipe, cocktail d'entreprise, séminaire de 20 à 200 personnes :
          Nimara s'occupe de tout, du devis à la livraison dans tout le canton.
        </p>
        <ul style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:2rem;font-size:.92rem">
          {% set services = [
            "Box petit-déjeuner dès 10 personnes",
            "Buffet Saveurs du Monde dès 30 personnes",
            "Déjeuners corporate livrés à Genève",
            "Formules sur devis dès 50 personnes",
            "Livraison incluse dans tout le canton"
          ] %}
          {% for s in services %}
          <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center">
            <span style="color:var(--lavender-lt)">✓</span> {{ s }}
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem">
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text={{ site.whatsappMessage | urlencode }}"
             class="btn btn-whatsapp"
             target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Demander un devis</a>
          <a href="/carte/#formules" class="btn btn-light">Voir les formules</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2" style="gap:.75rem">
        {% set offres = [
          { icon: "🥐", label: "Box Petit-Déjeuner", desc: "Dès 10 pers." },
          { icon: "🌍", label: "Saveurs du Monde", desc: "Cocktail dès 30 pers." },
          { icon: "🍱", label: "Formule Déjeuner", desc: "Dès 15 pers." },
          { icon: "🎉", label: "Buffet Complet", desc: "Sur mesure" }
        ] %}
        {% for o in offres %}
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.15);border-radius:14px;padding:1.4rem;text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:.6rem">{{ o.icon }}</div>
          <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;color:white;margin-bottom:.2rem">{{ o.label }}</div>
          <div style="font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">{{ o.desc }}</div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ STATS ══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      {% set stats = [
        { value: "2018", label: "Fondée à Genève" },
        { value: "25+", label: "Produits à la carte" },
        { value: "500+", label: "Clients fidèles" },
        { value: "100%", label: "Fait maison chaque jour" }
      ] %}
      {% for s in stats %}
      <div>
        <div class="stat-value" style="color:var(--lavender-lt)">{{ s.value }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">{{ s.label }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TEAM PREVIEW ═══════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Notre équipe</span>
      <h2>Des artisans passionnés<br>à votre service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      {% for member in team %}
      <a href="/equipe/{{ member.id }}/" class="team-card" style="text-decoration:none;display:block;cursor:pointer">
        <div class="team-card__photo">{{ member.name | truncate(1, true, '') }}</div>
        <div class="team-card__body">
          <h3 class="team-card__name">{{ member.name }}</h3>
          <p class="team-card__role">{{ member.role }}</p>
          <p class="team-card__bio" style="display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden">{{ member.bio }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TESTIMONIALS ═══════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Avis clients</span>
      <h2>Ils nous font confiance</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      {% set testimonials = [
        { stars: "★★★★★", text: "Le Brookie le plus fondant de Genève, point final. On commande les box corporate chaque vendredi depuis 6 mois.", name: "Sophie M.", location: "RH, Pictet & Cie" },
        { stars: "★★★★★", text: "Le buffet Saveurs du Monde pour notre séminaire de 45 personnes était parfait. Les currys et samosas ont fait l'unanimité. Merci Nimara !", name: "Yann D.", location: "Directeur, startup fintech" },
        { stars: "★★★★★", text: "Cheesecake Spéculos exceptionnel. On est venus pour une pâtisserie, on est repartis avec une box entière. Comme d'habitude.", name: "Claire & Thomas B.", location: "Clients depuis 2020" }
      ] %}
      {% for t in testimonials %}
      <div class="testimonial animate-fade-up">
        <div class="testimonial__stars">{{ t.stars }}</div>
        <p class="testimonial__text">"{{ t.text }}"</p>
        <div class="testimonial__author">
          <div class="testimonial__avatar">{{ t.name | truncate(1, true, '') }}</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial__name">{{ t.name }}</div>
            <div class="testimonial__location">{{ t.location }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ CTA BANNER ════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--lavender-lt)">Commandez maintenant</span>
    <h2>Prêt pour le meilleur<br>repas de votre journée ?</h2>
    <p>Passez commande via WhatsApp en 2 minutes. Livraison ou retrait à Genève.</p>
    <div class="btn-actions">
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text={{ site.whatsappMessage | urlencode }}"
         class="btn btn-whatsapp"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/>
        </svg>
        Commander sur WhatsApp
      </a>
      <a href="/carte/" class="btn btn-light">Voir la carte complète</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* ── Hero mosaic ─── */
.hero--full { position: relative; min-height: 92vh; display: flex; align-items: center; }
.hero-bg-mosaic {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
}
.mosaic-cell {
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
}
.mosaic-cell--1 { grid-column: 1 / 3; grid-row: 1 / 3; }
.mosaic-cell--2 { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
.mosaic-cell--3 { grid-column: 4; grid-row: 1; }
.mosaic-cell--4 { grid-column: 3 / 5; grid-row: 2; }
.mosaic-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,13,48,.88) 0%, rgba(26,13,48,.6) 60%, rgba(26,13,48,.35) 100%);
}
.hero-container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.display-serif { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }

/* ── Universe splits ─── */
.universe-split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: center;
}
.universe-split--reverse { direction: rtl; }
.universe-split--reverse > * { direction: ltr; }
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .universe-split, .universe-split--reverse { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; direction: ltr; }
}
.universe-text p { color: var(--gray-600); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.universe-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; margin-top: .75rem; }
.ubadge {
  font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em;
  background: rgba(91,44,141,.1); color: var(--violet); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
}
.ubadge--light {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
}

/* ── Universe mosaic grid ─── */
.umosaic-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: 200px 160px;
  gap: 8px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.umosaic-img {
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: transform .4s ease;
}
.umosaic-img:hover { transform: scale(1.03); }
.umosaic-img--tall { grid-row: 1 / 3; }

/* ── Product strip ─── */
.product-strip-scroll {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding-bottom: 1rem;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
}
.product-strip-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 4px; }
.product-strip-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--cream); border-radius: 2px; }
.product-strip-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--lavender); border-radius: 2px; }
.product-strip-card {
  min-width: 180px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: white;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
}
.product-strip-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(91,44,141,.12); }
.product-strip-img {
  height: 140px;
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
}
.product-strip-body { padding: .75rem; }
.product-strip-tag { font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--violet); }
.product-strip-name { font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-top: .2rem; }
</style>
